        Hi, I am a fifth-year PhD student in the Environmental Group at Toulouse
        School of Economics.
        <br />
        My advisor is Christian Gollier.
      </p>
      <h2>Research interests</h2>
      <p>
        <b>Main: </b>Environmental and energy economics
        <br />
        <b>Secondary: </b>Political economics, optimization, and numerical
        methods
      </p>
      <p>
        My main <a href="/research/">research</a> project and upcoming{" "}
        <a href="/jmp.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          job market paper
        </a>{" "}
        is about the cost efficiency of a fully renewable electricity mix under
        weather uncertainty in Germany.
      </p>
      <p>
        <b>Email: </b>
        <a href="mailto:konrad.dierks@tse-fr.eu">konrad.dierks@tse-fr.eu</a>
      </p>
